# Set 1 · Q. No. 4 · Gender Mainstreaming: Tools, Achievements and Limits of the GAD Strategy
@py pr_question 1 Q4

## The answer map
::: fig mindmap | The answer map: every branch is one numbered heading of the model answer below.
@note Define gender mainstreaming as GAD's strategy, explain its tools, weigh what it has achieved against its limits worldwide and in Pakistan, and judge how it can transform rather than tick boxes.
@ask What is GENDER MAINSTREAMING? Discuss its TOOLS; evaluate its ACHIEVEMENTS and LIMITATIONS
@ask as the STRATEGY of GAD, with reference to PAKISTAN
(1) Introduction: GAD's strategy — powerful idea, uneven practice
